  "critique": {
    "axis": "aesthetics",
    "evidence": "Strong dark security-lab art direction, restrained cyan/red accents, clear headline hierarchy, and a polished desktop kill-chain diagram. However, desktop atlas cards visibly clip text along the left edge; tablet/mobile replace the diagram with a visually plain numbered grid; the JSON panel shows awkward horizontal truncation; and the global header feels cramped and incomplete at smaller widths, with clipped navigation and faint underlying content showing through on tablet. Small, low-contrast mono labels also weaken legibility.",
